From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sargun Vohra <sargunv@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 23:26:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Carry premultiplied plugin default colors
 (maplibre-native#4663)

Premultiplies registered plugin default colors when the style system
adopts them, matching style-parsed colors. Merged upstream as
https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native/pull/4663 on 2026-09-21; drop
this patch once the FFI moves its maplibre-native pin past it.

Carried by maplibre-plugins from maplibre-native-ffi PR #731 until it lands
upstream.
---
 .mise/bin/sync-submodules                     |  1 +
 ...24-premultiply-plugin-default-colors.patch | 27 +++++++++++++++++++
 patches/maplibre-native/README.md             |  6 +++++
 3 files changed, 34 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 patches/maplibre-native/0024-premultiply-plugin-default-colors.patch

diff --git a/.mise/bin/sync-submodules b/.mise/bin/sync-submodules
index 8b79168..31c8860 100755
--- a/.mise/bin/sync-submodules
+++ b/.mise/bin/sync-submodules
@@ -71,6 +71,7 @@ mln_patches=(
   "$repo_root/patches/maplibre-native/0021-location-indicator-bearing-accuracy.patch"
   "$repo_root/patches/maplibre-native/0022-plugin-animated-layers.patch"
   "$repo_root/patches/maplibre-native/0023-source-free-plugin-layers.patch"
+  "$repo_root/patches/maplibre-native/0024-premultiply-plugin-default-colors.patch"
 )
 
 # The patches overlap, so no single patch reverses cleanly on its own once the
diff --git a/patches/maplibre-native/0024-premultiply-plugin-default-colors.patch b/patches/maplibre-native/0024-premultiply-plugin-default-colors.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..45685f7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/patches/maplibre-native/0024-premultiply-plugin-default-colors.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+diff --git a/include/mln/plugin/plugin_api.h b/include/mln/plugin/plugin_api.h
+index 80db38ef804..9fec4636270 100644
+--- a/include/mln/plugin/plugin_api.h
++++ b/include/mln/plugin/plugin_api.h
+@@ -101,6 +101,8 @@ typedef struct mln_plugin_double2 {
+     double y;
+ } mln_plugin_double2;
+ 
++/* Straight-alpha color. The host premultiplies registered defaults when it
++ * adopts them into the style system. */
+ typedef struct mln_plugin_color {
+     float r;
+     float g;
+diff --git a/src/mln/style/plugin_property.cpp b/src/mln/style/plugin_property.cpp
+index 413324f98d0..1fa0128d16a 100644
+--- a/src/mln/style/plugin_property.cpp
++++ b/src/mln/style/plugin_property.cpp
+@@ -84,7 +84,8 @@ Color defaultValue<Color>(const plugin::PropertyDefinition& definition) {
+     if (const auto* array = definition.defaultValue.getArray(); array && array->size() == result.size()) {
+         for (size_t i = 0; i < result.size(); ++i) result[i] = numericValue<float>((*array)[i]).value_or(0.0f);
+     }
+-    return {result[0], result[1], result[2], result[3]};
++    // Registered defaults arrive straight; Color is premultiplied.
++    return {result[0] * result[3], result[1] * result[3], result[2] * result[3], result[3]};
+ }
+ 
+ template <>
diff --git a/patches/maplibre-native/README.md b/patches/maplibre-native/README.md
index 6f8867c..94824a9 100644
--- a/patches/maplibre-native/README.md
+++ b/patches/maplibre-native/README.md
@@ -135,6 +135,12 @@ camera-to-center distance, a mercator world projection, and a ground-offset
 destination helper. This patch is local-only: it is not upstreamed, and no
 upstream PR exists.
 
+`0024-premultiply-plugin-default-colors.patch` premultiplies registered plugin
+default colors when they are adopted into the style system, matching the
+premultiplied-alpha `Color` invariant that style-parsed colors already honor.
+Upstream:
+[maplibre-native#4663](https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native/pull/4663).
+
 Each patch is the squashed diff of its upstream branch, applied on top of the
 patches before it, so a patch that adds a test next to an earlier patch's test
 carries that placement rather than the branch's own context.
